The Gates Foundation Gave $7 Million to a Company Studying Genetically Engineered Ticks. 450,000 Americans Now Have a Meat Allergy From a Tick Bite.

No direct evidence connecting the two — that has been stated clearly. But the lone star tick has been genetically changed. A World Science Festival speaker described this exact mechanism as intentional human engineering a decade ago. Gates has billions in fake meat. He has publicly said cows need to be eliminated for climate reasons. And his foundation funded tick bioengineering research. You are allowed to ask the question.

